01:22:31,360 --> 01:22:33,600
And eight mouths
to feed is a lot.

1499
01:22:33,760 --> 01:22:37,459
And the fish I caught is just
not enough food for all of us.

1500
01:22:37,460 --> 01:22:39,600
Did everybody get a piece? OK.

1501
01:22:39,760 --> 01:22:42,900
That sample is good,
I'll take a full serving.

1502
01:22:43,060 --> 01:22:45,500
We still have a week
left and bigger teams

1503
01:22:45,660 --> 01:22:46,960
mean bigger challenges.

1504
01:22:47,130 --> 01:22:48,859
And we know we have
the biggest challenge

1505
01:22:48,860 --> 01:22:50,260
yet to go with this escape.

1506
01:22:51,160 --> 01:22:52,500
It's been tough out here.

1507
01:22:52,660 --> 01:22:54,700
Somebody who's
been here three times.

1508
01:22:54,860 --> 01:22:57,860
This is tough. This
Hell on Earth in Africa.

1509
01:22:59,160 --> 01:23:00,960
Any number of
things could go wrong.

1510
01:23:01,130 --> 01:23:03,659
It's hard to have eight people
and have all eight of 'em

1511
01:23:03,660 --> 01:23:05,559
on the same page.

1512
01:23:05,560 --> 01:23:07,159
This is one of the most
brutal environments

1513
01:23:07,160 --> 01:23:08,659
I've ever been in.

1514
01:23:08,660 --> 01:23:10,060
This is savage.

1515
01:23:10,230 --> 01:23:12,260
Everyone's pushed
to their limits,

1516
01:23:12,430 --> 01:23:14,760
and we still have
a long way to go.

1517
01:23:14,930 --> 01:23:16,600
There's no one
coming to save us.

1518
01:23:16,760 --> 01:23:18,459
We're on our own.

1519
01:23:18,460 --> 01:23:19,800
We need to get
out of this place.

1520
01:23:21,860 --> 01:23:25,700
Hopefully, there is a way
to escape this hellish prison.

